   "id": "e6_lake",
   "music": "mystery",
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "NAR",
     "en": "One day, parched with thirst, the brothers came to a still lake. A voice warned: answer my questions before you drink.",
     "hi": "एक दिन प्यास से व्याकुल भाई एक शांत सरोवर पर पहुँचे। एक आवाज़ ने चेताया: पहले मेरे प्रश्नों का उत्तर दो, फिर जल पियो।"
    },
    {
     "who": "NAR",
     "en": "One by one, they drank, and fell.",
